<li>Master's degree (Mechanical Engineering, 1923) — University of Alabama</li>
<li>Marie Curie lectures (1925) — La Sorbonne</li>
<li>Doctorate of Philosophy (Physics, 1928) — Oxford University</li>
</ul>
<h2>Paten</h2>
